{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s06-p01",
      "text": "What subject do you worry about the most at school?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p02",
      "text": "Many students worry about maths.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p03",
      "text": "Some students can't sleep well the day before a maths exam.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p04",
      "text": "Others may feel very nervous during the exam itself.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p05",
      "text": "But there might be a way to make the subject less stressful.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p06",
      "text": "For students who are worried about maths, posture makes a big difference.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p07",
      "text": "Researcher Erik Peper told Daily Mail, 'Sitting up straight in your chair can help you do better in maths exams.'",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p08",
      "text": "Researchers tested 125 college students.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p09",
      "text": "They asked them to do a maths exam while sitting in a slumped-over position, or sitting up straight.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p10",
      "text": "After the test, 56% of the students said the exam was easier to do if they were sitting up straight.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p11",
      "text": "They found the sound of the clock or the bell less annoying and felt less awful about the exam.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p12",
      "text": "Slumping over is a defensive posture.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p13",
      "text": "It can bring out negative memories in the body and brain.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p14",
      "text": "'This can stop you from thinking clearly,' Peper said.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p15",
      "text": "A pain in your back can also make it harder to focus.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p16",
      "text": "Musicians, sports players and public speakers can all benefit from a good posture.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p17",
      "text": "When you feel stressed out, you can also try to sit up straight or stand tall.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p18",
      "text": "How do we maintain a good posture?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p19",
      "text": "Some PE classes may help you correct your posture.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p20",
      "text": "For computer-based exams, keeping your keyboard at the right height can be helpful.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-p21",
      "text": "A good posture can benefit you forever in various aspects of life.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s06-p21.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
